      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated clinicians alongside varied client experiences"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most clients commend the neurologists, case managers, and veterinary nurses for attentive and dedicated clinical care. Reviewers frequently highlight compassionate guidance from Dr. Wong and case coordinator Jen during intense treatment plans. However, several dissatisfied pet owners felt that doctor communication was limited or that their concerns were dismissed during difficult visits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Detailed clinical updates alongside mixed callbacks"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many reviewers praise case managers and nurses for frequent phone calls, daily progress updates, and thorough explanations of MRI imaging. Conversely, a few pet owners report frustration when trying to reach lead neurologists directly or encountering blunt financial discussions during stressful intake calls."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Specialized spinal surgery with mixed outcomes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently report successful surgical treatments for severe intervertebral disc disease and spinal trauma, with many dogs regaining mobility and walking again. However, several reviewers experienced heartbreaking outcomes where pets did not recover or passed away despite intensive medical interventions and emergency neurosurgery."
      }
    }
  ],
